hadiths[45]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1194","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye muamla, yani khilafat, Quraish mein rahay ga jab tak logon mein se do baaqi rahein. (Muslim: 6/3). (Bukhari ki riwayat mein hai ke un mein se do baaqi rahein; amr se murad yahan khilafat hai.)"
"1195","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Log is muamlay, yani hukumat mein Quraish ke taabe hain, un ke Musalman un ke Musalmanon ke taabe hain aur un ke kafir un ke kafiron ke taabe hain. (Muslim: 6/2)"
"1196","[AI-translation] Amir bin Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne ghulam Nafi ke saath Jabir bin Samura ko likha ke mujhe us cheez ki khabar do jo tum ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne mujhe likha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Juma ke din, Aslami ke rajm ki shaam ko farmatay hue suna: Ye deen qayem rahay ga yahan tak ke qayamat qayem ho ya tum par barah khalifa hon, sab Quraish mein se. Aur main ne Aap ko farmatay hue suna: Musalmanon ki choti jamaat Kisra ke safed ghar, yani Kisra ya Aal-e-Kisra ke ghar ko fatah karay gi. Aur main ne Aap ko farmatay hue suna: Beshak qayamat se pehle jhootay honge, to un se bacho. Aur main ne Aap ko farmatay hue suna: Jab Allah tum mein se kisi ko khair de to wo apni zaat aur apne ghar walon se shuru karay. Aur main ne Aap ko farmatay hue suna: Main Hauz par tumhara pesh khaima hun. (Muslim: 6/4). Baab: Janasheen muqarrar karna aur chhorna."
"1197","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Hafsa (raziyallahu anha) ke paas dakhil hua to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jantay ho ke tumharay walid (kisi ko) janasheen nahi banayein ge? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo aisa nahi karein ge. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak wo aisa karein ge. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne qasam khai ke main is baaray mein un se kalaam karun ga. To main khamosh raha yahan tak ke subah hui aur main ne un se kalaam na kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To main goya apne daaein haath se pahar uthaye hue tha yahan tak ke main wapas aaya. To main un ke paas dakhil hua to unhon ne mujh se logon ke haal ke baaray mein poocha aur main unhein batata raha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne un se kaha: Beshak main ne logon se baat suni hai aur qasam khai hai ke main usay tum se kahun ga. Wo guman kartay hain ke tum (kisi ko) janasheen nahi banao ge. Aur beshak agar tumhara oonton ya bakriyon ka charwaha ho phir wo tumharay paas aaye aur unhein chhor de to tum samjho ge ke us ne zaya kiya. To logon ki dekh bhaal zyada sakht hai. Unhon ne kaha: To meri baat ne unhein mutafakkir kiya. To unhon ne ghari bhar sar jhukaya phir meri taraf uthaya aur farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala apne deen ki hifazat karay ga. Aur beshak agar main janasheen na banaun to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne janasheen nahi banaya tha. Aur agar main janasheen banaun to Abu Bakr ne janasheen banaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Jab unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Abu Bakr ka zikr kiya to main samajh gaya ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke barabar kisi ko nahi rakhein ge aur wo (kisi ko) janasheen nahi banayein ge. (Muslim: 6/5)"
"1198","[AI-translation] Abu Hazim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath paanch saal baitha raha. To main ne unhein Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kartay hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Bani Israil ki siyasat anbiya kartay thay. Jab koi Nabi faut hota to us ka janasheen Nabi hota. Aur beshak mere baad koi Nabi nahi, aur jald khalifa honge aur bohat honge. Unhon ne kaha: To ham Aap ko kya hukm detay hain? Aap ne farmaya: Pehlay se pehlay ki bai'at poori karo aur unhein un ka haq do, beshak Allah un se us ke baaray mein poochay ga jo us ne unhein sonpa. (Muslim: 6/17)"
"1199","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abd Rabbul Ka'ba se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main masjid mein dakhil hua to Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) Ka'ba ke saaye mein baithay thay aur log un par jama thay. To main un ke paas aaya aur un ke paas baith gaya. To unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath safar mein thay. To ham aik manzil mein utray. To ham mein se baaz apna khaima durust karta tha, baaz teerandazi karta tha aur baaz apne maweshiyon mein tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munadi ne pukara: Namaz jama karnay wali hai. To ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas jama ho gaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak mujh se pehle koi Nabi nahi guzra magar us par lazim tha ke wo apni ummat ko us khair ki taraf rehnumai karay jo wo un ke liye janta ho aur unhein us shar se darae jo wo un ke liye janta ho. Aur beshak tumhari ye ummat, us ki aafiyat us ke awwal mein rakhi gayi hai, aur us ke aakhir ko aazmaish aur aisay muamlaat pahunchein ge jinhein tum bura samjho ge. Aur fitna aaye ga to us ka baaz baaz ko halka kar de ga. Aur fitna aaye ga to momin kahay ga: Ye meri halakat hai, phir wo khatm ho jaye ga. Aur fitna aaye ga to momin kahay ga: Ye, ye. To jo chahta hai ke usay aag se door kiya jaye aur jannat mein dakhil kiya jaye to usay maut is haal mein aaye ke wo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, aur logon ke paas wohi le kar aaye jo wo pasand karta hai ke us ke paas laya jaye. Aur jo imam ki bai'at karay aur usay apne haath ka soda aur apne dil ka phal de to wo us ki itaat karay agar taqat rakhta ho. Phir agar koi aur aaye jo us se jhagray to doosray ki gardan maar do. To main us se qareeb hua aur us se kaha: Main tumhein Allah ki qasam deta hun, kya tum ne ye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai? To us ne apne donon haathon se apne kaanon aur apne dil ki taraf ishara kiya aur kaha: Mere kaanon ne suna aur mere dil ne yaad kiya. To main ne us se kaha: Ye tumharay chachazaad Muawiya hamein hukm detay hain ke ham apne maal aapas mein naahaq khayein aur apne aap ko qatl karein jabke Allah Taala farmata hai: Ae iman walon! Apne maal aapas mein naahaq na khao siwae is ke ke aapas ki razamandi se tijarat ho, aur apne aap ko qatl na karo. Beshak Allah tum par rehem karnay wala hai. Unhon ne kaha: To wo ghari bhar khamosh raha, phir kaha: Allah ki itaat mein us ki itaat karo aur Allah ki nafarmani mein us ki nafarmani karo. (Muslim: 6/18). Baab: Jab do khalifaon ki bai'at ki jaye. (Intizaal se murad teerandazi hai; jashar se murad maweshi hain jo charagah mein rahein; fitnon ka baaz baaz ko halka karna un ki shiddat ki wajah se hai.)"
"1200","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab do khalifaon ki bai'at ki jaye to aakhir ko qatl kar do. (Muslim: 6/23). Baab: Tum mein se har aik nigehban hai aur har aik se us ki riaaya ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga."
"1201","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Khabardar! Tum mein se har aik nigehban hai aur tum mein se har aik se us ki riaaya ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga. To jo baadshah hai wo logon par nigehban hai aur us se us ki riaaya ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga. Aur mard apne ghar walon par nigehban hai aur us se un ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga. Aur aurat apne shohar ke ghar aur us ke bachon par nigehban hai aur us se un ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga. Aur ghulam apne aaqa ke maal par nigehban hai aur us se us ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga. Khabardar! Tum mein se har aik nigehban hai aur tum mein se har aik se us ki riaaya ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga. (Muslim)."
"1202","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Samura se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abdur Rahman! Hukumat na mango. Beshak agar tumhein wo maangnay par di gayi to tum us ke hawalay kar diye jao ge, aur agar tumhein baghair maangay di gayi to us par tumhari madad ki jaye gi. (Muslim: 6/5). (Wukkilt se murad us ke hawalay kar diya jana, madad se mehroomi hai.)"
"1203","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Beshak main tumhein kamzor dekhta hun, aur beshak main tumharay liye wohi pasand karta hun jo apne liye pasand karta hun. Do (aadmiyon) par hukumat na karna aur yateem ke maal ka wali na banna. (Muslim: 6/7)"
"1204","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya Aap mujhe aamil nahi banayein ge? Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne apna haath mere kandhay par maara, phir farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Beshak tum kamzor ho, aur beshak ye amanat hai, aur beshak ye qayamat ke din ruswai aur sharmindagi hai siwae us ke jis ne usay us ke haq se liya aur jo us mein us par tha usay ada kiya. (Muslim: 6/6). Baab: Ham apne kaam par usay aamil nahi banatay jo usay mangay."
"1205","[AI-translation] Abu Burda se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Musa ne kaha: Main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur mere saath Ash'ariyon mein se do mard thay, aik meray daaein aur doosra meray baaein. To donon ne kaam manga jabke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) miswak kar rahay thay. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Musa, ya Ae Abdullah bin Qais, tum kya kehtay ho? Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke saath bheja hai, unhon ne mujhe apne dilon ki baat nahi batayi thi aur mujhe maloom na tha ke wo kaam maangein ge. Unhon ne kaha: Aur goya main Aap ki miswak ko Aap ke honth ke neechay dekh raha hun jabke wo sukad gayi thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ham apne kaam par usay aamil nahi banayein ge jo usay mangay, lekin tum jao, Ae Abu Musa, ya Ae Abdullah bin Qais. To Aap ne unhein Yemen ki taraf bheja, phir un ke peechay Muaz bin Jabal ko bheja. Phir jab Muaz un ke paas aaye to unhon ne kaha: Utro. Aur un ke liye takiya dala. To wahan aik mard tha jo bandha hua tha. Unhon ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Yahudi tha, phir Musalman hua, phir apne buray deen ki taraf wapas gaya aur Yahudi ho gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main nahi baithun ga yahan tak ke wo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke faislay se qatl kiya jaye. Aap ne farmaya: Baitho, haan. Unhon ne kaha: Main nahi baithun ga yahan tak ke wo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke faislay se qatl kiya jaye. Teen baar. To unhon ne us ke baaray mein hukm diya aur wo qatl kiya gaya. Phir donon ne raat ke qiyam ka zikr kiya. To un mein se aik, Muaz ne kaha: Raha main, to main sota hun aur qiyam karta hun, aur apni neend mein usi ka ummeedwar hun jis ka apne qiyam mein ummeedwar hun. (Muslim: 6/6). Baab: Imam jab Allah ka taqwa ka hukm de aur insaf karay to us ke liye ajar hai."
"1206","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Imam dhaal hai, us ke peechay ho kar lara jata hai aur us se bacha jata hai. Phir agar wo Allah Taala ke taqway ka hukm de aur insaf karay to us ke liye is se ajar hai, aur agar wo us ke siwa hukm de to us par us mein se (gunah) hai. (Muslim: 6/17). (Junna se murad bachao hai, yani imam bachao ki tarah hai kyunke wo Musalmanon ko dushmanon ki takleef se bachata hai.)"
"1207","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak insaf karnay walay Allah ke nazdeek Rahman ke daaein noor ke mimbaron par honge, aur Us ke donon haath daaein hain. Wo jo apne faislay mein, apne ghar walon mein aur jo unhein sonpa gaya us mein insaf kartay hain. (Muslim: 6/7). Baab: Jo kisi muamlay ka wali bana phir sakhti ya narmi ki."
"1208","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Shamasa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aisha ke paas kisi cheez ke baaray mein poochnay aaya, Muslim mein hai ke un se poochnay aaya. To unhon ne kaha: Tum kin mein se ho? To main ne kaha: Misr ke rehnay walon mein se aik mard. To unhon ne kaha: Tumharay saathi ne tumharay is ghazway mein tumharay saath kaisa kiya? To us ne kaha: Ham ne us par koi aib nahi lagaya. Agar ham mein se kisi ka oont mar jata to wo usay oont deta, ghulam (mar jata) to usay ghulam deta, aur kharch ka mohtaj hota to usay kharch deta. To unhon ne kaha: Khabardar! Jo us ne mere bhai Muhammad bin Abu Bakr se kiya wo mujhe nahi rokta ke main tumhein bataun jo main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is mere ghar mein kehtay hue suna: Ae Allah! Jo meri ummat ke muamlay mein se kisi ka wali bana phir un par sakhti ki to Tu us par sakhti kar, aur jo meri ummat ke muamlay mein se kisi ka wali bana phir un se narmi ki to Tu us se narmi kar. (Muslim: 6/7). Baab: Deen khairkhwahi hai."
"1209","[AI-translation] Tamim Dari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Deen khairkhwahi hai. Ham ne kaha: Kis ke liye? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke liye, Us ki kitab ke liye, Us ke Rasool ke liye, Musalmanon ke aaimma ke liye aur un ke aam logon ke liye. (Muslim: 1/53)"
"1210","[AI-translation] Jarir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se namaz qaim karnay, zakat denay aur har Musalman ki khairkhwahi par bai'at ki. (Muslim: 1/54). Baab: Jo apni riaaya se dhoka karay aur un ki khairkhwahi na karay."
"1211","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Ziyad Maqil bin Yasar Muzani ki us beemari mein iyadat ko aaya jis mein wo faut hue. Maqil ne kaha: Beshak main tumhein hadees bayan karta hun jo main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni, agar main janta ke meri zindagi hai to main tumhein na bayan karta. Beshak main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Koi banda nahi jisay Allah riaaya ka nigehban banaye, phir wo us din maray jab wo maray aur wo apni riaaya se dhoka karnay wala ho, magar Allah ne us par jannat haraam kar di. (Muslim: 6/9)"
"1212","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai ke Aiz bin Amr (raziyallahu anhu), jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se thay, Ubaidullah bin Ziyad ke paas dakhil hue aur kaha: Ae betay! Beshak main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Beshak badtareen charwahay zulm karnay walay hain, to bacho ke tum un mein se ho. To us ne us se kaha: Baitho, tum Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ke bhusay mein se ho. To us ne kaha: Kya un mein bhusa tha? Bhusa to un ke baad aur un ke siwa (logon) mein tha. (Muslim: 6/9)"
"1213","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik din ham mein khaday hue aur maal-e-ghaneemat mein khayanat ka zikr kiya aur usay bara samjha aur us ke muamlay ko bara samjha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Main tum mein se kisi ko na paun ke wo qayamat ke din apni gardan par oont liye aaye jis ki awaz ho, wo kahay: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri madad karo. To main kahun: Main tumharay liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, main ne tumhein pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko na paun ke wo qayamat ke din apni gardan par ghoda liye aaye jis ki awaz ho, wo kahay: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri madad karo. To main kahun: Main tumharay liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, main ne tumhein pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko na paun ke wo qayamat ke din apni gardan par bakri liye aaye jis ki awaz ho, wo kahay: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri madad karo. To main kahun: Main tumharay liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, main ne tumhein pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko na paun ke wo qayamat ke din apni gardan par jaan liye aaye jis ki cheekh ho, wo kahay: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri madad karo. To main kahun: Main tumharay liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, main ne tumhein pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko na paun ke wo qayamat ke din apni gardan par kapray liye aaye jo hil rahay hon, wo kahay: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri madad karo. To main kahun: Main tumharay liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, main ne tumhein pahuncha diya tha. Main tum mein se kisi ko na paun ke wo qayamat ke din apni gardan par sona chandi liye aaye, wo kahay: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri madad karo. To main kahun: Main tumharay liye kuch ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, main ne tumhein pahuncha diya tha. (Muslim: 6/10). Baab: Aamilon ne jo chupaya wo khayanat hai."
"1214","[AI-translation] Adi bin Amira Kindi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jisay ham tum mein se kisi kaam par aamil banayein aur wo ham se sui ya us se zyada chupaye wo khayanat hai jo wo qayamat ke din le kar aaye ga. Unhon ne kaha: To Ansaar mein se aik siyah mard us ki taraf khada hua, goya main usay dekh raha hun. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujh se apna kaam wapas le lijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhein kya hai? Us ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko aisa aisa kehtay suna. Aap ne farmaya: Aur main ab bhi yehi kehta hun: Jisay ham tum mein se kisi kaam par aamil banayein wo thora aur zyada le kar aaye. Phir jo us mein se usay diya jaye wo le aur jis se usay roka jaye wo ruk jaye. (Muslim: 6/12). Baab: Aamilon ke hadiyon ke baaray mein. (Asal mein fayaji hai, Muslim mein falyaji hai.)"
"1215","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Azd, Muslim ke aik nuskhay mein hai ke Azd, jinhein Azd Shanuah kehtay hain aur Azd aur Asad kehtay hain, mein se aik mard, jinhein Ibn Lutbiya kaha jata hai, jinhein Muslim ke aik nuskhay mein Atbiya kaha gaya, ko Banu Sulaim ke sadqaat par aamil banaya. Phir jab wo aaya to Aap ne us ka hisab liya. Us ne kaha: Ye tumhara maal hai aur ye hadiya hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir tum apne baap aur apni maan ke ghar mein kyun na baithay yahan tak ke tumharay paas tumhara hadiya aata agar tum sachay ho? Phir Aap ne hamein khutba diya, Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana bayan ki. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Amma baad! Beshak main tum mein se mard ko us kaam par aamil banata hun jo Allah ne mujhe sonpa hai. Phir wo mere paas aata hai aur kehta hai: Ye tumhara maal hai aur ye hadiya hai jo mujhe diya gaya. To wo apne baap aur apni maan ke ghar mein kyun na baitha yahan tak ke us ke paas us ka hadiya aata agar wo sachay hon? Allah ki qasam! Tum mein se koi is mein se naahaq kuch nahi le ga magar wo qayamat ke din Allah Taala se milega jabke wo usay uthaye hue hoga. To main tum mein se kisi ko zaroor pehchanun ga jo Allah se milega jabke wo awaz nikalta oont uthaye hue hoga, ya awaz nikalti gaaye, ya cheekhti bakri. Phir Aap ne apne donon haath buland kiye yahan tak ke Aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi gayi. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Kya main ne pahuncha diya? Meri aankh ne dekha aur mere kaan ne suna. (Muslim: 6/11-12). (Aksar nuskhon mein fala'rifanna hai, baaz mein la a'rifanna nafi ke sath jo mashhoor hai.)"
"1216","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Hudaibiya ke din chaudah sau thay. To ham ne Aap se bai'at ki jabke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) darakht ke neechay Aap ka haath pakray hue thay, aur wo samura (ka darakht) tha. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Ham ne Aap se is par bai'at ki ke ham nahi bhagein ge, aur ham ne Aap se maut par bai'at nahi ki. (Muslim: 6/25)"
"1217","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abul Ja'd se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se darakht walon ke baaray mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Agar ham aik laakh hotay to wo hamein kaafi hota. Ham pandra sau thay. (Muslim: 6/26). (Ye Hudaibiya ke kuwen ke baaray mein sahih hadees ka mukhtasar hai; sahaba ne us ka pani kam paya to Nabi ne us mein thooka aur barkat ki dua ki to wo ubal para.)"
"1218","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Aufa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Darakht walay terah sau thay, aur Aslam Muhajireen ka aathwan hissa thin. (Muslim: 6/26). Baab: Maut par bai'at karna."
"1219","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Ubaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salama se kaha: Tum ne Hudaibiya ke din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kis par bai'at ki? Unhon ne kaha: Maut par. (Muslim: 6/27). Baab: Sun-nay aur itaat par bai'at karna jitni taqat ho."
"1220","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sun-nay aur itaat par bai'at kartay thay, Aap ham se kehtay thay: Jitni tum taqat rakhtay ho. (Muslim: 6/29). Baab: Sun-nay aur itaat ki bai'at siwae is ke ke khula kufr dekhein."
"1221","[AI-translation] Junada bin Abu Umayya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Ubada bin Samit ke paas dakhil hue jabke wo beemar thay. To ham ne kaha: Allah tumhein tandrust karay, hamein hadees bayan karo jis se Allah hamein faida de jo tum ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni. To unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein bulaya aur ham ne Aap se bai'at ki. To jo Aap ne ham se liya us mein tha ke Aap ne ham se sun-nay aur itaat par bai'at li hamari khushi aur naapasandeedgi mein, hamari tangi aur aasani mein, aur ham par tarjeeh mein, aur ke ham hukm walon se hukm ke liye na jhagrein. Aap ne farmaya: Siwae is ke ke tum khula kufr dekho jis par tumharay paas Allah ki taraf se daleel ho. (Muslim: 6/17). Baab: Hijrat karnay wali momin auraton ka bai'at ke waqt imtihan."
"1222","[AI-translation] Aisha, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Momin aurtein jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf hijrat kar ke aatin thin to un ka Allah Taala ke qaul se imtihan liya jata tha: Ae Nabi! Jab tumharay paas momin aurtein bai'at karnay aayein ke wo Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek nahi karein gi, chori nahi karein gi, aur apni auladon ko qatl nahi karein gi, aur apne haathon aur paon se gharr kar buhtan nahi layein gi, aur neki mein tumhari nafarmani nahi karein gi, to un se bai'at lo aur un ke liye Allah se bakhshish mango. Beshak Allah bakhsh nay wala rehem karnay wala hai. To jo aurat in baton ka iqraar karti wo goya bai'at ka iqraar karti. Aur jab wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay zuban se iqraar kartin to Aap farmatay: Jao, main ne tum se bai'at le li. Allah ki qasam! Nabi ka haath kisi aurat ke haath ko nahi laga, balke Aap un se sirf zuban se bai'at detay thay. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne auraton se us ke siwa koi bai'at nahi li jis ka Allah ne hukm diya tha. (Muslim)."
"1223","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo meri itaat karay us ne Allah ki itaat ki, aur jo meri nafarmani karay us ne Allah ki nafarmani ki. Aur jo mere ameer ki itaat karay us ne meri itaat ki, aur jo mere ameer ki nafarmani karay us ne meri nafarmani ki. (Muslim: 6/13). Baab: Us ki sama'at aur itaat jo Allah ki kitab par amal karay."
"1224","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Husain se, apni dadi Umm Husain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne unhein kehtay hue suna: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Hajjat-ul-Wida kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bohat kalaam farmaya. Phir main ne Aap ko farmatay hue suna: Agar tum par kata pita siyah ghulam bhi ameer banaya jaye jo tumhein Allah Taala ki kitab se chalaye to usay suno aur us ki itaat karo. (Muslim: 6/15). Baab: Allah ki nafarmani mein koi itaat nahi, itaat sirf neki mein hai."
"1225","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne lashkar bheja aur un par aik mard ko ameer banaya. To us ne aag jalayi aur kaha: Is mein dakhil ho jao. To baaz logon ne us mein dakhil honay ka irada kiya aur doosron ne kaha: Ham to us (aag) se bhaag kar Musalman hue hain. To ye baat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr ki gayi. To Aap ne un se farmaya jo dakhil honay ka irada rakhtay thay: Agar tum us mein dakhil hotay to qayamat tak usi mein rehtay. Aur Aap ne doosron se achi baat kahi. Aur farmaya: Allah ki nafarmani mein koi itaat nahi, itaat sirf neki mein hai. (Muslim: 6/15). Baab: Jab gunah ka hukm diya jaye to na sun-na hai na itaat."
"1226","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Musalman mard par sun-na aur itaat lazim hai jo wo pasand karay aur napasand karay, siwae is ke ke usay gunah ka hukm diya jaye. Phir agar usay gunah ka hukm diya jaye to na sun-na hai na itaat. (Muslim: 6/15). Baab: Ameerun ki itaat chahe wo huqooq rokein."
"1227","[AI-translation] Wail Hadrami se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Salama bin Yazid Jufi ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Bataiye, agar ham par aise hukmaran qayem hon jo ham se apna haq maangein aur hamara haq hamein na dein to Aap hamein kya hukm detay hain? To Aap ne us se munh pher liya. Phir us ne Aap se poocha to Aap ne us se munh pher liya. Phir us ne doosri ya teesri baar Aap se poocha to Ash'as bin Qais ne usay khencha aur kaha: Suno aur itaat karo, beshak un par wohi hai jo un par hai aur tum par wohi hai jo tum par hai. (Muslim)."
"1228","[AI-translation] Auf bin Malik se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Tumharay behtareen imam wo hain jin se tum mohabbat kartay ho aur wo tum se mohabbat kartay hain, aur wo tumharay liye dua kartay hain aur tum un ke liye dua kartay ho. Muslim mein hai ke tum un par durood bhejho aur wo tum par durood bhejein. Aur tumharay badtareen imam wo hain jin se tum bughz rakhtay ho aur wo tum se bughz rakhtay hain, tum un par lanat kartay ho aur wo tum par lanat kartay hain. Kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya ham un se talwaron se na larein? Muslim mein hai ke talwaar se. To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, jab tak wo tum mein namaz qayem karein. Aur jab tum apne hukmaranon se koi cheez dekho jo tum napasand kartay ho to us ke amal ko bura samjho aur itaat se haath na khencho. (Muslim: 6/24). Baab: Ameerun par inkar aur jab tak namaz padhein un se laraai chhorna."
"1229","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha), Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum par ameer muqarrar honge, to tum pehchano ge aur inkar karo ge, yani tum un ke baaz amalon ko acha samjho ge aur baaz ko bura. To jo (dil se) bura samjhay wo bari ho gaya, aur jo (dil se) inkar karay wo mehfooz raha, lekin jo raazi hua aur pairwi ki (wo halak hua). Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya ham un se na larein? Muslim mein hai ke kya ham un se na larein. Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, jab tak wo namaz padhein, yani jo dil se bura samjhay aur dil se inkar karay. (Muslim: 6/23). Baab: Tarjeeh par sabar ka hukm."
"1230","[AI-translation] Usaid bin Hudair (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansaar mein se aik mard Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se tanhai mein mila aur kaha: Kya Aap mujhe aamil nahi banayein ge jaisa Aap ne falan ko aamil banaya? To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum mere baad tarjeeh pao ge, to sabar karo yahan tak ke mujh se Hauz par milo. (Muslim: 6/19). Baab: Fitnon ke zaahir honay par jamaat se chimtay rehnay ka hukm."
"1231","[AI-translation] Huzaifa bin Yaman (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se khair ke baaray mein poochtay thay aur main Aap se shar ke baaray mein poochta tha is khauf se ke wo mujhe paa le. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak ham jahiliyat aur shar mein thay, phir Allah hamein ye khair le kar aaya. To kya is khair ke baad shar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. To main ne kaha: Kya us shar ke baad khair mein se kuch hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur us mein dhund hai. Main ne kaha: Us ka dhund kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aisi qaum jo meri sunnat ke siwa tareeqay par chalay gi aur mere rastay ke siwa hidayat par, Muslim mein hai ke hidayat paye gi. Tum un mein achai aur burai pehchano ge. To main ne kaha: Kya us khair ke baad shar mein se kuch hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, Jahannam ke darwazon par bulanay walay. Jo unhein qabool karay ga wo usay us mein phenk dein ge. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Unhein hamaray liye bayan kijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Haan, Muslim mein hum nahi hai. Wo hamari khaal ki qaum hai, yani hamaray nafs aur qabeelay mein se, aur hamari zabano se kalaam karti hai. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar main us waqt ko paun to mujhe kya hukm detay hain? Aap ne farmaya: Musalmanon ki jamaat aur un ke imam se chimtay raho. To main ne kaha: Agar jamaat na ho aur na imam? Aap ne farmaya: Phir un sab girohon se alag raho chahe tumhein darakht ki jar chatni paray, aur usi haal mein raho yahan tak ke tumhein maut aa jaye. (Muslim)."
"1232","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo itaat se nikla aur jamaat se juda hua, phir mara, to wo jahiliyat ki maut mara. Aur jo andhi jhanday talay lara, asabiyyat par ghussa hua, ya asabiyyat ki taraf bulaya, ya asabiyyat ki madad ki, phir qatl hua, to us ka qatl jahiliyat ka hai. Aur jo meri ummat par nikla aur us ke naik o bad ko maaray, us ke momin se na bachay aur ahad walay ka ahad poora na karay, to wo mujh se nahi aur main us se nahi. (Muslim: 6/21). (Hanat se murad andha muamla hai; asaba mard ke baap ki taraf se rishtadar hain.)"
"1233","[AI-translation] Nafi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar, Abdullah bin Muti ke paas aaye jab Harra ka waqiya hua Yazid bin Muawiya ke zamanay mein. To us ne kaha: Abu Abdur Rahman ke liye bistar bichhao. To us ne kaha: Beshak main tumharay paas baithnay nahi aaya, main tumharay paas tumhein hadees bayan karnay aaya hun jo main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna. Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jo itaat se haath khencha wo qayamat ke din Allah se milega jabke us ke paas koi daleel na hogi. Aur jo mara jabke us ki gardan mein bai'at na ho wo jahiliyat ki maut mara. (Muslim: 6/22). Baab: Us ke baaray mein jo ummat muthid ho us ka muamla muntashir karay."
"1234","[AI-translation] Arfaja (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Beshak jald fitnay aur fitnay honge. To jo is ummat ka muamla muntashir karna chahay jabke wo muthid ho, to usay talwaar se maaro, wo jo bhi ho. (Muslim: 6/22). Baab: Jo ham par hathyar uthaye wo ham mein se nahi."
"1235","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo ham par hathyar uthaye wo ham mein se nahi, aur jo hamein dhoka de wo ham mein se nahi. (Muslim: 1/69). Baab: Allah ki rassi se chimtay rehnay aur tafraq chhornay ka hukm."
"1236","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumharay liye teen pasand karta hai aur tumharay liye teen napasand karta hai. Wo tumharay liye pasand karta hai ke tum us ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, aur ke tum sab Allah ki rassi se chimtay raho aur tafraq na karo. Aur wo tumharay liye napasand karta hai qeel o qaal, kasrat se sawal aur maal zaya karna. (Muslim: 5/130)"
"1237","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Ibrahim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qasim bin Muhammad se us mard ke baaray mein poocha jis ke teen ghar hon aur wo har ghar ke teesray hissay ki wasiyyat karay. Unhon ne kaha: Wo sab aik ghar mein jama kiya jaye ga. Phir unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne bataya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo aisa amal karay jis par hamara hukm nahi wo radd hai. (Muslim: 5/132). Baab: Us ke baaray mein jo neki ka hukm de aur khud na karay."
"1238","[AI-translation] Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Un se kaha gaya: Kya tum Usman ke paas dakhil ho kar us se kalaam nahi kartay? To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum samajhtay ho ke main us se kalaam nahi karta magar tumhein sunata hun? Muslim mein hai ke kya tumhein sunata hun. Allah ki qasam! Beshak main ne us se us muamlay mein kalaam kiya jo mere aur us ke darmiyan hai, is se kam ke main aisa muamla shuru karun jisay main pasand nahi karta ke main pehla hun jis ne usay khola, yani aam majlis mein aaimma par izhaar ke saath inkar, kyunke izhaar wali inkar mein us ka anjaam khaufnak hai jaisa Usman par izhaar wali inkar mein un ke qatl ka waqiya hua. Aur main kisi se jo mujh par ameer ho nahi kehta ke wo logon mein sab se behtar hai, jab main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Qayamat ke din aadmi laya jaye ga aur aag mein dala jaye ga. To us ke pait ki aantein nikal aayein gi. To wo un se chakkar lagaye ga jaisa gadha chakki se chakkar lagata hai. To us ke paas dozakh walay jama honge aur kahein ge: Ae falan! Tumhein kya hai? Kya tum neki ka hukm nahi detay thay aur burai se nahi roktay thay? To wo kahay ga: Kyun nahi, beshak main neki ka hukm deta tha aur usay nahi karta tha, aur burai se rokta tha aur usay karta tha. (Muslim: 8/224). (Aatain nikalnay se murad hai.)"
